# Sidequest: Play Blitzball: "At the beginning of combat on your turn, target creature you control gets +2/+0 until end of turn."
# On turn 3 Anaba Bodyguard (2/3) gets +2/+0 and attacks with Elite Vanguard (2/1): 4 + 2 is exactly 6 combat damage to Bot2
# (20 to 14), so at the end of combat Blitzball transforms into World Champion, Celestial Weapon and Bot1 chooses Elite Vanguard
# (not the pumped Anaba) to attach it to: Vanguard has +2/+0 (4/1) and double strike; Anaba is 4/3 from the pump alone.
# Anaba and Elite Vanguard come in on turn 1 (Black Lotus and Mox Ruby; Mox Pearl), Blitzball on turn 3 (Moxes).

